{
  "title": "ChangePointLab: A Unified Python Toolkit for Changepoint Detection",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "publication_date": "2026-07-23",
  "description": "ChangePointLab is an open-source Python library that unifies classical and modern approaches to changepoint detection. It implements Bayesian Online Change Point Detection, Pruned Exact Linear Time segmentation, energy-distance divisive algorithms, Hidden Markov and semi-Markov models, state-dependent HMMs for compositional data, kernel-based methods, and within-period detectors for seasonal signals. A consistent API, lightweight NumPy dependency, validation utilities, examples, and documentation support reproducible experiments across binary, continuous, multivariate, periodic, and compositional time series.",
